<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Akurumi NT</book>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ncaza me utaaro me Yohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ncaza me utaaro me</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Me Borewono wo ukura wo Ashini, nre ne uyane wo ncaza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Niya ke biruwanke bom Gayus, awaasa n-yeme-wo ne aməmo kiwenden.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Biruwanke bom, nre ne nriribina bociye ucugi wo ugofe wo uniyamto wo nipum, a unaafase wo kuwede yina anyaanaha-bo didəy, tantaasa bidiri bobo bigofe uniyamto. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />ᐩN-yane nsano me iruwa gay sa ananke aruwanke hare udafe wo Yeso ˂akaye ᐩabiyate-m tantaasa ˃bopiti kiwenden nnoo, ne tiyang tebo ne aməmo kiwenden ka. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Azaa apuwa sa apere ꞊uniyaze wom nsano me iruwa ka ngofe a ayiyane ham adafe kiwenden.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Suga wom, bo a bore kiwenden ne aməmo apuwa sa ꞊boyane aruwanke, ne aruwanke sa ajan. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />˂Akabiyate hare udafe uyeme wobo. Ata ayane unoo bokandeke-ha ne apuwa ha tiyang hay sa ayane unoo ne hare nituma ne Ashini. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />A wərike ubiyare wo anaza ha Animasihu ˂akakaane, ˂akagaa akpaa ukande ke haremay sa haza hare udafe wo Yeso. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Ayane unoo tiyane agana hayen ukande, wərike tire nsuga ne aməmo nituma ne kiwenden.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />˂Nkiyane hare udafe ncaza, ama Diyotirifis sa utare ure bo uciba, umaa kuwede ana, ᐩugaa-wo ukpaa wo anaza haaro. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ka n-ye, nta mmiyate apuwa sa ꞊uyane ne nsaa, wərike anaza araa sa ꞊unaze ne ashini haaro. Hayen adaake ahama-wo, ꞊ugaaza-wo ꞊ukpaaza wo aruwanke. Ukuri ꞊ukareze haremay sa atare ꞊ukpaaza woha, a ꞊ukattize-ha ne aməmo hare udafe.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Biruwanke bom, kate bodafe uyane wo apuwa araa ama sa bodafe uyane wo anowa. Awaasa ꞊uyane anowa ake Ashini udine. Awaasa ꞊uyane apuwa araa utiya-wo Ashini. <verse eid="3JN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Kuwede ana ꞊unaze anaza anowa ne ashini ha Dimitiriyus, anongo kiwenden kidonkize. Haromaa duki, tinaze apuwa anowa ne ashini hawo, ye, iriya apuwa sa tinaze ne ashini hawo, a kiwenden.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Nciye apuwa gay sa ntare ncaze-ye ne, ama nnitara-m mbiyate-ye ne aməmo ncaza may. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />ᐩNwuna iruwa nta nnay-bo ne aməmo aye cim, wərike tiyane anaza ne bo ayizi ayate ayizi. <verse eid="3JN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Uraara wo iruwa niye kebo. Nsugan maaro baazee, anyakize-bo. Nyankiza nsugan maaro kuwedebijebu sa are bano.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>